"},{"hebrew":"בַּגּוֹיִם","transliteration":"BAGOYM","portuguese":"","number":"1.2"},{"hebrew":"בָּזוּי","transliteration":"BÅZUY","portuguese":"","number":"1.2"},{"hebrew":"אַתָּה","transliteration":"ATÅH","portuguese":"","number":"1.2"},{"hebrew":"מְאֹד:","transliteration":"MËOD:","portuguese":"","number":"1.2"}]},{"book_abbrev":"ob","chapter":1,"verse":3,"text_pt":"A soberba do teu coração te enganou, como o que habita nas fendas das rochas, na sua alta morada, que diz no seu coração: Quem me derribará em terra?","words":[{"hebrew":"זְדוֹן","transliteration":"ZËDON","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"לִבְּךָ","transliteration":"LIBËKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"הִשִּׁיאֶךָ","transliteration":"HISHYEKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"שֹׁכְנִי","transliteration":"SHOKHËNY","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"בְחַגְוֵי- סֶּלַע","transliteration":"VËCHAGËVEY-SELA","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"מְרוֹם","transliteration":"MËROM","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"שִׁבְתּוֹ","transliteration":"SHIVËTO","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"אֹמֵר","transliteration":"OMER","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"בְּלִבּוֹ","transliteration":"BËLIBO","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"מִי","transliteration":"MY","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"יוֹרִדֵנִי","transliteration":"YORIDENY","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"},{"hebrew":"אָרֶץ:","transliteration":"ÅRETS:","portuguese":"","number":"1.3"}]},{"book_abbrev":"ob","chapter":1,"verse":4,"text_pt":"Se te elevares como águia, e puseres o teu ninho entre as estrelas, dali te derribarei, diz o SENHOR.","words":[{"hebrew":"אִם- תַּגְבִּיהַּ","transliteration":"IM-TAGËBYHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.4"},{"hebrew":"כַּנֶּשֶׁר","transliteration":"KANESHER","portuguese":"","number":"1.4"},{"hebrew":"וְאִם- בֵּין","transliteration":"VËIM-BEYN","portuguese":"","number":"1.4"},{"hebrew":"כּוֹכָבִים","transliteration":"KOKHÅVYM","portuguese":"","number":"1.4"},{"hebrew":"שִׂים","transliteration":"SYM","portuguese":"","number":"1.4"},{"hebrew":"קִנֶּךָ","transliteration":"QINEKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.4"},{"hebrew":"מִשָּׁם","transliteration":"MISHÅM","portuguese":"","number":"1.4"},{"hebrew":"אוֹרִידְךָ","transliteration":"ORYDËKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.4"},{"hebrew":"נְאֻם- יְהוָה:","transliteration":"NËUM-YHVH:","portuguese":"","number":"1.4"}]},{"book_abbrev":"ob","chapter":1,"verse":5,"text_pt":"Se viessem a ti ladrões, ou roubadores de noite (como estás destruído!), não furtariam o que lhes bastasse? se a ti viessem os vindimadores, não deixariam alguns cachos?","words":[{"hebrew":"אִם- גַּנָּבִים","transliteration":"IM-GANÅVYM","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"בָּאוּ- לְךָ","transliteration":"BÅU-LËKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"אִם- שׁוֹדְדֵי","transliteration":"IM-SHODËDEY","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"לַיְלָה","transliteration":"LAYËLÅH","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"אֵיךְ","transliteration":"EYKH","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"נִדְמֵיתָה","transliteration":"NIDËMEYTÅH","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"הֲלוֹא","transliteration":"HALO","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"יִגְנְבוּ","transliteration":"YGËNËVU","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"דַּיָּם","transliteration":"DAYÅM","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"אִם- בֹּצְרִים","transliteration":"IM-BOTSËRYM","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"בָּאוּ","transliteration":"BÅU","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"לָךְ","transliteration":"LÅKH","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"הֲלוֹא","transliteration":"HALO","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"יַשְׁאִירוּ","transliteration":"YASHËYRU","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"},{"hebrew":"עֹלֵלוֹת:","transliteration":"OLELOT:","portuguese":"","number":"1.5"}]},{"book_abbrev":"ob","chapter":1,"verse":6,"text_pt":"Como foram buscados os bens de Esaú! como foram esquadrinhados os seus esconderijos!","words":[{"hebrew":"אֵיךְ","transliteration":"EYKH","portuguese":"","number":"1.6"},{"hebrew":"נֶחְפְּשׂוּ","transliteration":"NECHËPËSU","portuguese":"","number":"1.6"},{"hebrew":"עֵשָׂו","transliteration":"ESÅV","portuguese":"","number":"1.6"},{"hebrew":"נִבְעוּ","transliteration":"NIVËU","portuguese":"","number":"1.6"},{"hebrew":"מַצְפֻּנָיו:","transliteration":"MATSËPUNÅYV:","portuguese":"","number":"1.6"}]},{"book_abbrev":"ob","chapter":1,"verse":7,"text_pt":"Todos os teus confederados te levaram para fora dos teus limites: os que gozam da tua paz te enganaram, prevaleceram contra ti; os que comem o teu pão puseram debaixo de ti uma armadilha: não há em Edom entendimento.","words":[{"hebrew":"עַד- הַגְּבוּל","transliteration":"AD-HAGËVUL","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"שִׁלְּחוּךָ","transliteration":"SHILËCHUKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"כֹּל","transliteration":"KOL","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"אַנְשֵׁי","transliteration":"ANËSHEY","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"בְרִיתֶךָ","transliteration":"VËRYTEKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"הִשִּׁיאוּךָ","transliteration":"HISHYUKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"יָכְלוּ","transliteration":"YÅKHËLU","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"לְךָ","transliteration":"LËKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"אַנְשֵׁי","transliteration":"ANËSHEY","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"שְׁלֹמֶךָ","transliteration":"SHËLOMEKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"לַחְמְךָ","transliteration":"LACHËMËKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"יָשִׂימוּ","transliteration":"YÅSYMU","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"מָזוֹר","transliteration":"MÅZOR","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"תַּחְתֶּיךָ","transliteration":"TACHËTEYKHA","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"אֵין","transliteration":"EYN","portuguese":"","number":"1.7"},{"hebrew":"תְּבוּנָה","transliteration":"TËVUNÅ